          "end": 8.97,
          "relative_start": 1.97,
          "relative_end": 8.97,
          "en": "South Korea may have an ant problem, although it's not these type of ants, but rather these.",
          "zh": "韩国可能有个蚂蚁问题，不过不是这种蚂蚁，而是这些。",
