        {
          "index": 2,
          "start": 13.97,
          "end": 18.97,
          "relative_start": 13.97,
          "relative_end": 18.97,
          "en": "There are more than 14 million return investors in South Korea who are called ants.",
          "zh": "韩国有超过1400万散户市场参与者，被称为蚂蚁。",
          "zh_highlights": [],
          "en_highlights": [
            "return investors"
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "start": 18.97,
          "end": 24.97,
          "relative_start": 18.97,
          "relative_end": 24.97,
          "en": "Individually, they don't have much power, but collectively they have a greater influence in the market.",
          "zh": "单个看，他们力量不大，但合起来对市场影响巨大。",
          "zh_highlights": [
            "市场影响"
          ],
          "en_highlights": [
            "greater influence"
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 4,
          "start": 25.97,
          "end": 31.97,
          "relative_start": 25.97,
          "relative_end": 31.97,
          "en": "These ants have been busy. Not by more than 100% so far this year, just an unbelievable rally.",
          "zh": "这些蚂蚁很忙，今年涨幅超100%，涨势惊人。",
          "zh_highlights": [
