        {
          "index": 5,
          "start": 31.97,
          "end": 35.97,
          "relative_start": 31.97,
          "relative_end": 35.97,
          "en": "It's really quite extraordinary what's happening in Korean stocks at the moment.",
          "zh": "韩国权益资产现在的表现确实非同寻常。",
          "zh_highlights": [
            "非同寻常"
          ],
          "en_highlights": [
            "quite extraordinary"
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 6,
          "start": 35.97,
          "end": 42.97,
          "relative_start": 35.97,
          "relative_end": 42.97,
          "en": "The KOSPI index, which tracks Korea's public companies, climbed 200% over the last 12 months.",
          "zh": "追踪韩国上市公司的KOSPI指数过去12个月上涨了200%。",
          "zh_highlights": [
            "KOSPI指数"
          ],
          "en_highlights": [
            "KOSPI index"
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 7,
          "start": 42.97,
          "end": 50.97,
          "relative_start": 42.97,
          "relative_end": 50.97,
          "en": "Compare that to other major markets, like the S&P or even the NASDAQ, and Korea's performance blows them out of the water.",
          "zh": "与其他主要市场如标普或纳斯达克相比，韩国表现遥遥领先。",
