          "start": 50.97,
          "end": 56.97,
          "relative_start": 50.97,
          "relative_end": 56.97,
          "en": "That means it has more than tripled over the past 12 months retail investors.",
          "zh": "这意味着过去12个月散户市场参与者的收益翻了三倍多。",
          "zh_highlights": [
            "翻了三倍多"
