          "end": 59.97,
          "relative_start": 56.97,
          "relative_end": 59.97,
          "en": "They've been the main driver of the KOSPI.",
          "zh": "他们是KOSPI上涨的主要推手。",
          "zh_highlights": [
            "主要推手"
          ],
          "en_highlights": [
            "main driver"
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 10,
          "start": 59.97,
          "end": 65.97,
          "relative_start": 59.97,
          "relative_end": 65.97,
          "en": "We can see signs of being a little bit maniac and a lot of people borrowing money to invest in stocks.",
          "zh": "可以看到一些狂热迹象，很多人借钱投入权益资产。",
          "zh_highlights": [
