          ],
          "en_highlights": [
            "signs of being a little bit maniac"
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 11,
          "start": 65.97,
          "end": 70.97,
          "relative_start": 65.97,
          "relative_end": 70.97,
          "en": "And amid the maniac is a mounting fear that a bubble will soon burst.",
          "zh": "在狂热中，人们越来越担心泡沫即将破裂。",
          "zh_highlights": [
